@startuml state_diagram

title Task State Transitions (via Task methods)

[*] --> PENDING

PENDING --> IN_PROGRESS : mark_in_progress()
IN_PROGRESS --> DONE : mark_done()
DONE --> PENDING : reopen()

note right of PENDING
  is_pending() returns true
end note

note right of IN_PROGRESS
  is_in_progress() returns true
end note

note right of DONE
  is_completed() returns true
end note

@enduml